00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.100
The girls in Figueroa dress beautifully,

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:18.933
they have great nails,

00:16:18.933 --> 00:16:20.460
they have braces to fix their teeth,

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.150
they have nice cars.

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:24.030
- Yes we don't have any
of those things here.

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:25.370
- [Interviewer] I don't wanna
give too much information,

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.150
but some of the girls are
driving Mercedes Benz's

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:28.210
and all kinds of...

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:31.570
And then Skid Row is where
people don't have anything.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:32.403
- No.

00:16:32.403 --> 00:16:33.430
- [Interviewer] They
don't have bank accounts,

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:34.740
they don't have money in their pockets,

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:35.610
they don't have shoes,

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:36.570
they don't have anything.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:37.403
Very different.

00:16:37.403 --> 00:16:40.000
- Yes, very much so different.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.841
There's no similarities.

00:16:41.841 --> 00:16:42.674
- [Interviewer] Yeah.

00:16:42.674 --> 00:16:43.690
